{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a **modern, premium, fully responsive Shopify footer section** inspired by high-end eCommerce brands. The footer should be built as a **Shopify Theme Section (`sections/footer.liquid`)** and follow Shopify Online Store 2.0 best practices.
    
    ## General Requirements
    
    * Build using Shopify Liquid.
    * Fully responsive for desktop, tablet, and mobile.
    * Clean, modern, minimal design.
    * Dark background (#111 or configurable).
    * White typography with subtle grey secondary text.
    * Proper spacing and alignment.
    * Accessible semantic HTML.
    * Fast loading.
    * No hardcoded values.
    * Every visible element should be editable from the Shopify Theme Customizer.
    
    ---
    
    # Layout
    
    Create a **3-column layout**.
    
    ### Column 1 - Brand
    
    Include:
    
    * Uploadable Logo
    * Adjustable logo width
    * Store tagline (editable)
    * Short business description (editable)
    * Optional copyright text
    * Social media icons (optional toggle)
    
    Settings:
    
    * Logo Upload
    * Logo Width Slider
    * Brand Description
    * Show/Hide Social Icons
    * Social Links
    
    ---
    
    ### Column 2 - Quick Links
    
    Heading:
    
    Quick Links
    
    Create editable menu links.
    
    Support:
    
    * Search
    * Privacy Policy
    * Refund Policy
    * Shipping Policy
    * Terms of Service
    
    Requirements:
    
    * Menu should be selectable from Shopify Navigation.
    * Merchant should be able to choose any menu.
    * Links automatically update.
    * Hover effect.
    
    Settings:
    
    * Heading
    * Navigation Menu Picker
    
    ---
    
    ### Column 3 - Customer Service
    
    Heading:
    
    Customer Service
    
    Include editable fields:
    
    * WhatsApp Number
    * Email Address
    * Business Address (optional)
    * Working Hours
    * Return Policy Text
    * Custom Support Text
    
    Display icons beside each item.
    
    Example layout:
    
    📞 WhatsApp us on +92 XXX XXXXXXX
    
    ✉ [support@example.com](mailto:support@example.com)
    
    📍 Lahore, Pakistan
    
    🕒 Mon-Sat 9AM–7PM
    
    🔄 7 Days Easy Returns & Exchanges
    
    Every field should be optional.
    
    ---
    
    # Bottom Bar
    
    Create another footer row containing:
    
    Left:
    
    © 2026 Store Name. All Rights Reserved.
    
    Right:
    
    Payment Method Icons
    
    Support:
    
    Visa
    
    MasterCard
    
    Apple Pay
    
    Google Pay
    
    PayPal
    
    COD
    
    Merchant can:
    
    Toggle payment icons
    
    Upload custom payment image
    
    Change copyright
    
    ---
    
    # Design Customization
    
    Add Shopify settings for:
    
    Background Color
    
    Heading Color
    
    Text Color
    
    Link Color
    
    Link Hover Color
    
    Divider Color
    
    Section Padding Top
    
    Section Padding Bottom
    
    Content Width
    
    Border Radius (optional)
    
    ---
    
    # Typography
    
    Editable:
    
    Heading Font Size
    
    Text Font Size
    
    Font Weight
    
    Letter Spacing
    
    Line Height
    
    ---
    
    # Mobile Behaviour
    
    Columns should stack vertically.
    
    Logo centered.
    
    Quick links centered.
    
    Customer service centered.
    
    Proper spacing between sections.
    
    Touch-friendly links.
    
    ---
    
    # Animations
    
    Optional fade-in animation.
    
    Smooth hover transitions.
    
    Link underline animation.
    
    Subtle logo hover.
    
    ---
    
    # Theme Editor Settings
    
    Everything should be editable including:
    
    * Logo Upload
    * Logo Width
    * Background Color
    * Heading Color
    * Text Color
    * Link Color
    * Hover Color
    * Quick Links Menu
    * Customer Service Heading
    * WhatsApp Number
    * Email
    * Address
    * Working Hours
    * Return Text
    * Copyright
    * Payment Icons Toggle
    * Social Icons Toggle
    * Section Padding
    * Border Top Toggle
    * Divider Color
    
    ---
    
    # Code Requirements
    
    Generate:
    
    * `sections/footer.liquid`
    * Complete schema
    * Proper Shopify settings
    * Clean Liquid code
    * CSS scoped to the section
    * Minimal JavaScript only if necessary
    * No external libraries
    * Compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0
    
    ---
    
    # Design Style
    
    Use a premium design similar to:
    
    * Nike
    * Gymshark
    * Apple
    * Allbirds
    * Fashion Nova
    
    The final result should look modern, elegant, highly customizable, and suitable for any professional eCommerce store, allowing merchants to manage every piece of footer content directly from the Shopify Theme Editor without modifying the code.
    
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.background_color }};
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    {% if section.settings.show_top_border %}
      border-top: 1px solid {{ section.settings.divider_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-footer-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ section.settings.content_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 60px;
    padding-bottom: 50px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ section.settings.divider_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-footer-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .ai-footer-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    max-width: {{ section.settings.logo_width }}px;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-footer-tagline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ section.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    letter-spacing: {{ section.settings.letter_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-footer-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ section.settings.text_font_size }}px;
    line-height: {{ section.settings.line_height }};
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .ai-footer-copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ section.settings.text_font_size | minus: 2 }}px;
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ section.settings.link_hover_color }};
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ai-footer-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .ai-footer-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ section.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    letter-spacing: {{ section.settings.letter_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-footer-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-footer-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ section.settings.text_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ section.settings.link_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    line-height: {{ section.settings.line_height }};
  }

  .ai-footer-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -2px;
    left: 0;
    width: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.link_hover_color }};
    transition: width 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    color: {{ section.settings.link_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover::after {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-footer-contact-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    font-size: {{ section.settings.text_font_size }}px;
    line-height: {{ section.settings.line_height }};
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-footer-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-footer-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    fill: {{ section.settings.heading_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-contact-link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ section.settings.link_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-contact-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    color: {{ section.settings.link_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-footer-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 30px;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-footer-bottom-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ section.settings.text_font_size | minus: 2 }}px;
    color: {{ section.settings.text_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-footer-payment-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-footer-payment-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    height: 24px;
    width: auto;
    opacity: 0.8;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-footer-payment-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .ai-footer-payment-custom-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    max-height: 30px;
    width: auto;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:first-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      text-align: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .ai-footer-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .ai-footer-social-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top | times: 0.7 }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
      padding-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      text-align: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:first-child {
      grid-column: 1;
    }

    .ai-footer-links-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      align-items: center;
    }

    .ai-footer-contact-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .ai-footer-bottom-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
      padding-top: 25px;
    }

    .ai-footer-payment-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  {% if section.settings.enable_animations %}
    @keyframes ai-footer-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      animation: ai-footer-fade-in-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.6s ease-out forwards;
    }

    .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1) {
      animation-delay: 0.1s;
    }

    .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }

    .ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 0.3s;
    }
  {% endif %}
{% endstyle %}

<footer class="ai-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-footer-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-footer-main-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      
      <div class="ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if section.settings.logo != blank %}
          <div class="ai-footer-logo-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <img
              src="{{ section.settings.logo | image_url: width: 400 }}"
              alt="{{ shop.name }}"
              width="{{ section.settings.logo_width }}"
              height="auto"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </div>
        {% else %}
          <h2 class="ai-footer-tagline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ shop.name }}</h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.tagline != blank %}
          <p class="ai-footer-tagline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ section.settings.tagline }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.description != blank %}
          <p class="ai-footer-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ section.settings.description }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.copyright_text != blank %}
          <p class="ai-footer-copyright-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ section.settings.copyright_text }}</p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.show_social_icons %}
          <div class="ai-footer-social-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% if section.settings.social_facebook != blank %}
              <a href="{{ section.settings.social_facebook }}" class="ai-footer-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Facebook">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M24 12.073c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.99 4.388 10.954 10.125 11.854v-8.385H7.078v-3.47h3.047V9.43c0-3.007 1.792-4.669 4.533-4.669 1.312 0 2.686.235 2.686.235v2.953H15.83c-1.491 0-1.956.925-1.956 1.874v2.25h3.328l-.532 3.47h-2.796v8.385C19.612 23.027 24 18.062 24 12.073z"/></svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if section.settings.social_instagram != blank %}
              <a href="{{ section.settings.social_instagram }}" class="ai-footer-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Instagram">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z"/></svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if section.settings.social_twitter != blank %}
              <a href="{{ section.settings.social_twitter }}" class="ai-footer-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Twitter">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M23.953 4.57a10 10 0 01-2.825.775 4.958 4.958 0 002.163-2.723c-.951.555-2.005.959-3.127 1.184a4.92 4.92 0 00-8.384 4.482C7.69 8.095 4.067 6.13 1.64 3.162a4.822 4.822 0 00-.666 2.475c0 1.71.87 3.213 2.188 4.096a4.904 4.904 0 01-2.228-.616v.06a4.923 4.923 0 003.946 4.827 4.996 4.996 0 01-2.212.085 4.936 4.936 0 004.604 3.417 9.867 9.867 0 01-6.102 2.105c-.39 0-.779-.023-1.17-.067a13.995 13.995 0 007.557 2.209c9.053 0 13.998-7.496 13.998-13.985 0-.21 0-.42-.015-.63A9.935 9.935 0 0024 4.59z"/></svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if section.settings.social_youtube != blank %}
              <a href="{{ section.settings.social_youtube }}" class="ai-footer-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="YouTube">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/></svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}

            {% if section.settings.social_tiktok != blank %}
              <a href="{{ section.settings.social_tiktok }}" class="ai-footer-social-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="TikTok">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.525.02c1.31-.02 2.61-.01 3.91-.02.08 1.53.63 3.09 1.75 4.17 1.12 1.11 2.7 1.62 4.24 1.79v4.03c-1.44-.05-2.89-.35-4.2-.97-.57-.26-1.1-.59-1.62-.93-.01 2.92.01 5.84-.02 8.75-.08 1.4-.54 2.79-1.35 3.94-1.31 1.92-3.58 3.17-5.91 3.21-1.43.08-2.86-.31-4.08-1.03-2.02-1.19-3.44-3.37-3.65-5.71-.02-.5-.03-1-.01-1.49.18-1.9 1.12-3.72 2.58-4.96 1.66-1.44 3.98-2.13 6.15-1.72.02 1.48-.04 2.96-.04 4.44-.99-.32-2.15-.23-3.02.37-.63.41-1.11 1.04-1.36 1.75-.21.51-.15 1.07-.14 1.61.24 1.64 1.82 3.02 3.5 2.87 1.12-.01 2.19-.66 2.77-1.61.19-.33.4-.67.41-1.06.1-1.79.06-3.57.07-5.36.01-4.03-.01-8.05.02-12.07z"/></svg>
              </a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if section.settings.quick_links_heading != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-footer-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ section.settings.quick_links_heading }}</h3>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.quick_links_menu != blank %}
          <ul class="ai-footer-links-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {% for link in linklists[section.settings.quick_links_menu].links %}
              <li>
                <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="ai-footer-link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ link.title }}
                </a>
              </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-footer-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if section.settings.customer_service_heading != blank %}
          <h3 class="ai-footer-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ section.settings.customer_service_heading }}</h3>
        {% endif %}

        {% if section.settings.whatsapp_number != blank %}
          <div class="ai-footer-contact-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-footer-contact-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z"/></svg>
